message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "FullPixel MSI Quant"
type: software
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
authors:
  - family-names: "Alderden"
    given-names: "Wessel"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WesAld/FullPixel-MSI-Quant"
url: "https://github.com/WesAld/FullPixel-MSI-Quant"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  A local R Shiny workflow for spectrum-sum-normalized full-pixel MALDI mass
  spectrometry imaging quantification from aligned MZmine features, with
  individual-sample, two-group, and multi-group descriptive analysis modes.
keywords:
  - MALDI-MSI
  - mass spectrometry imaging
  - metabolomics
  - MZmine
  - Shiny
  - spectrum-sum normalization
